messages.content:
{"message":"Yes. Airplane Mode being ON is blocking cellular service and mobile data.

Please turn Airplane Mode OFF on your phone. After that, make sure Mobile Data is ON. Since carrier-side roaming is now enabled and your phone’s Data Roaming is already ON, your phone should be able to reconnect to a cellular network while you are in France.

After turning Airplane Mode OFF and Mobile Data ON, check whether you see signal bars and 4G or 5G in the status bar."}

